title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.peso_dolar == null) { Q.peso_dolar = 12.5; }
if (Q.crecimiento == null) { Q.crecimiento = 6; }
if (Q.inflacion == null) { Q.inflacion = 4; }
Q.peso_display = Q.peso_dolar.toFixed(2);
Q.crecimiento_display = Q.crecimiento.toFixed(1);
Q.inflacion_display = Q.inflacion.toFixed(1);
Q.mando = 'estado';
if (Q.gran_capital > Q.burguesia_estado && Q.gran_capital >= Q.capital_extranjero) { Q.mando = 'capital'; }
if (Q.capital_extranjero > Q.burguesia_estado && Q.capital_extranjero > Q.gran_capital) { Q.mando = 'extranjero'; }
// --- forward-looking readouts: milestone gradients, pressure proximities, the clock ---
Q.municipios_rojos = (Q.municipio_alcozauca || 0) + (Q.municipio_juchitan || 0);
Q.des_max = Math.max(Q.des_ortodoxos || 0, Q.des_renovadores || 0, Q.des_nueva || 0);
Q.seats_faltan = Math.max(0, 10 - (Q.izq_seats || 0));
Q.miembros_faltan = Math.max(0, 25 - (Q.members || 0));
Q.casillas_faltan = Math.max(0, 30 - (Q.red_casillas || 0));
var _me = (Q.next_election_year || 0) - (Q.year || 0);
Q.meses_eleccion = _me * 12 + (7 - (Q.month || 1));
if (Q.meses_eleccion < 0) { Q.meses_eleccion = 0; }
if (Q.meses_eleccion > 96) { Q.meses_eleccion = 0; }
// --- sierra camino progress: make the war's milestones concrete ---
Q.pres_total = Math.round((Q.pres_guerrero||0)+(Q.pres_valle||0)+(Q.pres_chihuahua||0)+(Q.pres_jalisco||0)+(Q.pres_nl||0)+(Q.pres_oaxaca||0)+(Q.pres_tijuana||0));
Q.meses_bajo_tierra = Math.max(0, (Q.time||0) - (Q.armada_start||0));
// find the region closest to becoming a "zone" (presence high, garrison low)
var _zn=[['Guerrero',Q.pres_guerrero,Q.guar_guerrero],['Oaxaca',Q.pres_oaxaca,Q.guar_oaxaca],['Chihuahua',Q.pres_chihuahua,Q.guar_chihuahua],['el Valle',Q.pres_valle,Q.guar_valle]];
var _best=_zn[0]; for (var _i=0;_i<_zn.length;_i++){ if ((_zn[_i][1]||0) > (_best[1]||0)) _best=_zn[_i]; }
Q.zona_region = _best[0]; Q.zona_pres = Math.round(_best[1]||0); Q.zona_guar = Math.round(_best[2]||0);
// the counter-history, counted live: how many times has your Mexico refused the record?
Q.contrahistoria_n =
    (Q.lucio_vive == 1 ? 1 : 0)
  + ((Q.medrano_advisor == 1 || (Q.medrano_muerto == 1 && (Q.colonia_saga || 0) >= 1)) ? 1 : 0)
  + ((Q.campa_advisor == 1 || Q.campa_released == 1) ? 1 : 0)
  + (((Q.td_apoyo || 0) >= 1 || Q.spicer == 1) ? 1 : 0)
  + (Q.municipio_juchitan == 1 ? 1 : 0)
  + (Q.municipio_alcozauca == 1 ? 1 : 0)
  + (Q.praga_line == 1 ? 1 : 0)
  + ((Q.feminismo || 0) >= 60 ? 1 : 0)
  + ((Q.registro || 0) >= 1 ? 1 : 0)
  + ((Q.izq_senadores || 0) >= 1 ? 1 : 0)
  + (Q.ceb_aliado == 1 ? 1 : 0)
  + ((Q.compas_armadas || 0) >= 2 ? 1 : 0)
  + (Q.zona_gobernada == 1 ? 1 : 0);
!}

= The Movement

*Hover any highlighted term — people, institutions, mechanics — for context.*

= El pulso

[? if year <= 1969 and members < 8 : **First moves.** Click **El Movimiento** deck to draw a card, then click the card to play it — sector cards (Trabajo obrero, Colonias, Prensa…) raise the support that becomes your vote. Rotate an advisor when its action is ready. Read **El camino** below for the goal, and **Lo que viene** for the dangers. The saldo line after each action tells you what it cost. Nothing grows if no cards are played. ?]
[? if funds <= 6 : The treasury runs on coins. Some doors will stay shut until the caja is fed. ?]
[? if des_ortodoxos >= 45 or des_renovadores >= 45 or des_nueva >= 45 : A corriente is turning restless. Tend to the internal work, or the house will bleed. ?]
[? if expediente >= 60 : The file thickens. When it is this heavy, the four-a.m. knock is a matter of time — quiet the profile or invest in security. ?]
[? if unity <= 25 : The house is divided against itself. Mend it before the factions decide the matter for you. ?]
[? if represion >= 78 : The state has stopped managing and started ending. Lower the temperature, or the leadership will be taken one by one. ?]
[? if salario_real < 90 : The wage is bleeding. The factory gates and the colonias have never been more open — organize where the crisis bites. ?]
[? if registro >= 1 and red_casillas < 20 and year >= 1978 : The casilla network is thin. A vote is coming that will be won or stolen at the tables you fail to cover. ?]
[? if camino1 = 0 : The first task is survival — exist, hold the family at one table, reach 1971 intact. ?]
[? if camino1 = 1 and camino2 = 0 : Grow. Twenty-five thousand members is the wall the state cannot easily disappear. ?]
[? if camino2 = 1 and camino3 = 0 : The door of the reform is the next stone: registro, and seats to speak from. ?]
[? if camino3 = 1 and camino4 = 0 : Lay foundations the state cannot see: the casilla network, a town governed with open books. ?]
[? if camino4 = 1 and camino5 = 0 : The convergence: the united front, with the Movement as a founding wall. 1988 is the reckoning. ?]
[? if funds > 6 and expediente < 60 and unity > 25 and represion < 78 and (des_ortodoxos < 45 and des_renovadores < 45 and des_nueva < 45) : The Movement is steady this season. Press the advantage — organize, and read the road ahead. ?]


[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Funds: [+ funds +]

Members (thousands): [+ members +]

Organizers: [+ organizers +]

Unity: [+ unity +]

Political capital: [+ political_capital +]

Line on the armed question: [? if postura_guerrilla = 0 : undefined — silence is also read ?][? if postura_guerrilla = 1 : public deslinde ?][? if postura_guerrilla = 2 : calculated ambiguity ?][? if postura_guerrilla = 3 : discreet channels ?]

= El camino

[? if camino1 = 1 : I. Survive — DONE ?][? if camino1 = 0 : I. Survive: exist in 1971 with the structure alive. You have [+ members +],000 members (need 8) and unity [+ unity +] (need 40). ?]

[? if camino2 = 1 : II. Break the cerco — DONE ?][? if camino2 = 0 and camino1 = 1 : II. Break the cerco: 25,000 members. You have [+ members +],000 — [+ miembros_faltan +],000 to go. ?]

[? if camino3 = 1 : III. The door — DONE ?][? if camino3 = 0 and camino2 = 1 : III. The door: registro plus ten seats. Registro [+ registro +] (need 1); seats [+ izq_seats +] of 10 — [+ seats_faltan +] to go. ?]

[? if camino4 = 1 : IV. The foundations — DONE ?][? if camino4 = 0 and camino3 = 1 : IV. The foundations: a 30-casilla network and a red municipio. Network [+ red_casillas +] of 30 — [+ casillas_faltan +] to go; red municipios held: [+ municipios_rojos +] (need 1). The casilla card in El laberinto is the engine; win Alcozauca or hold Juchitán for the town. ?]

[? if camino5 = 1 : V. The convergence — DONE. July decides. ?][? if camino5 = 0 and camino4 = 1 : V. The convergence: the Frente forged, the fusion complete, the Corriente courted — with you as a founding wall. 1988 is the reckoning. ?]

= Lo que viene

*The board reads forward, not only back. What the next season is likely to bring — and what you still have time to prevent.*

[? if expediente >= 72 : **The file can take the leadership now.** At [+ expediente +], with repression high, the four-a.m. knock reaches the top table, not just the flanks. Quiet the profile or buy security — this season, not next. ?]
[? if expediente >= 60 and expediente < 72 : **The file has crossed the danger line.** At [+ expediente +] (the line is 60), when repression runs hot the state begins taking people, an advisor at a time. Lower the profile or protect the exposed. ?]
[? if expediente < 60 and expediente >= 45 : The file stands at [+ expediente +]; the danger line is 60. Room to act, but the raids come when it fattens. ?]

[? if des_max >= 65 : **A corriente has reached the fronda line** ([+ des_max +]/65). A split can be forced against you now — settle the internal account before someone else settles it for you. The corrientes card in El Movimiento is the instrument. ?]
[? if des_max >= 50 and des_max < 65 : The most restless corriente sits at [+ des_max +] of the 65 that triggers a fronda, and it drains unity every month it stays there. Rotate an advisor or honor its demand. ?]

[? if registro >= 1 and meses_eleccion >= 1 and meses_eleccion <= 15 : **An election is roughly [+ meses_eleccion +] months out.** It will be won or stolen at the casillas you cover — [+ red_casillas +] tables now — and answered afterward from the tribune or the street. You cannot build the network on the night; build it now. ?]

[? if destape_phase >= 1 and destape_phase <= 3 : **Succession season is open.** The next reign is being chosen behind the curtain. Position toward the likely tapado and harvest the nervous losers — the pasarela rewards those who read it early. ?]

[? if via = "armada" and moral_columnas < 45 : **The columns are near breaking** (morale [+ moral_columnas +]). Win something this season or desertions bleed your presence away. The amnesty door is still open — and it does not open every year. ?]
[? if via = "armada" and coronel_red >= 60 : **The Colonel can find you** (his network [+ coronel_red +]/100). Cut it, feed it lies, or take him off the board — or plan the descent while the terms are still yours. ?]
[? if via = "armada" and parque <= 4 : **The war is nearly out of materiel** (parque [+ parque +]). Without it the columns can only hide. Expropriate — or come down with the harvest while you can. ?]

[? if expediente < 60 and des_max < 50 and via != "armada" and (registro = 0 or meses_eleccion = 0 or meses_eleccion > 15) and (destape_phase = 0 or destape_phase = 4) : No storm on the near horizon. This is build weather — organize where the crisis bites, and position before the next reckoning names itself. ?]

= El haber del Movimiento

*The ledger of what has actually been won — not promised, won.*

[? if paros_ganados >= 1 : Huelgas ganadas: [+ paros_ganados +] — the machines stopped, and the floor learned it could stop them. ?]
[? if secciones_ganadas >= 1 : Secciones magisteriales conquistadas: [+ secciones_ganadas +] — teachers who answer to an assembly, not a charro. ?]
[? if cnte_fundada = 1 : La CNTE fue fundada — a national teachers' movement the SNTE cannot contain. ?]
[? if colonias_fundadas >= 1 : Colonias fundadas o regularizadas: [+ colonias_fundadas +] — pieces of the city that govern themselves. ?]
[? if conamup_fundada = 1 : La CONAMUP fue fundada — the urban poor, coordinated across the valley. ?]
[? if dotaciones >= 1 : Dotaciones de tierra arrancadas: [+ dotaciones +] — fences down, and kept down. ?]
[? if escandalos >= 1 : Escándalos destapados: [+ escandalos +] — seams worked in the regime's story until they showed. ?]
[? if alquimia_expuesta = 1 : La alquimia quedó documentada — the fraud is provable now. ?]
[? if registro >= 1 : Registro conquistado — the Party exists before the law at last. ?]
[? if izq_seats >= 1 : Curules en la Cámara: [+ izq_seats +] — a microphone the regime cannot switch off. ?]
[? if izq_senadores >= 1 : Senadurías conquistadas: [+ izq_senadores +] — the first opposition senators in the chamber’s history. The room that was unanimous for sixty years no longer is. ?]
[? if municipio_alcozauca = 1 : Alcozauca gobernada — the first red municipio of the Montaña. ?]
[? if municipio_juchitan = 1 : Juchitán gobernada — la COCEI holds the isthmus. ?]
[? if feminismo >= 60 : El movimiento de mujeres, del brazo — feminismo [+ feminismo +]/100: the autonomous feminist current organizes alongside the party, not beneath it, and the campus and the colonias answer for it. ?][? if feminismo >= 25 and feminismo < 60 : Con las feministas, a tientas — feminismo [+ feminismo +]/100: the women’s movement and the party circle each other, useful and wary. ?]
[? if fdn >= 1 : El Frente fue forjado — the convergence of 1988, with you inside it. ?]

[? if paros_ganados = 0 and secciones_ganadas = 0 and colonias_fundadas = 0 and dotaciones = 0 and escandalos = 0 and izq_seats = 0 and registro = 0 : Nothing decisive won yet — only built. The ledger fills the first time the state is made to give something back. ?]

= Tu contrahistoria

*This is a game of history and counter-history. The map and the ledger say who is winning. This says something the regime cares about more: how much of the record your Mexico has refused. It is the truest scoreboard here — the one the finale reads.*

[? if contrahistoria_n = 0 : So far your Mexico has followed the record — the dead stayed dead, the doors stayed shut, the towns stayed lost. The counter-history is still all ahead of you, and there is a great deal of decade left in which to bend it. ?]
[? if contrahistoria_n >= 1 : Divergences from the history that actually happened — [+ contrahistoria_n +] so far: [? if lucio_vive = 1 : Lucio Cabañas lives. ?][? if praga_line = 1 : The Prague heresy is kept — a communist party with a conscience. ?][? if feminismo >= 60 : The women's movement organizes as an equal, not beneath you. ?][? if registro >= 1 : The hammer and sickle is counted where it was only ever miscounted. ?][? if municipio_alcozauca = 1 : Alcozauca is held. ?][? if municipio_juchitan = 1 : Juchitán is held. ?][? if izq_senadores >= 1 : Opposition senators took the oath in a chamber with no protocol for them. ?] The full account waits in the Library. ?]

The list, meanwhile, is kept. Names added to the memorial on your watch: [+ memorial +]. The regime's deepest wager is that everyone forgets. This is how the wager is lost.

= Internal corrientes

Ortodoxos: [+ fac_ortodoxos : fuerza +] — mood: [+ des_ortodoxos : animo +][? if des_ortodoxos >= 60 : (they need Moscow respected or the tradition fed — soon) ?]

Renovadores: [+ fac_renovadores : fuerza +] — mood: [+ des_renovadores : animo +][? if des_renovadores >= 60 : (they need the electoral-democratic road honored — soon) ?]

Nueva izquierda: [+ fac_nueva_izquierda : fuerza +] — mood: [+ des_nueva : animo +][? if des_nueva >= 60 : (they need the street and the movements back on the agenda — soon) ?]

[? if des_ortodoxos >= 50 or des_renovadores >= 50 or des_nueva >= 50 : A corriente past 50 dissent drains unity monthly and can force a fronda. The corrientes card in El Movimiento deck is the instrument. ?]

= El sistema

President: [? if presidente == "Diaz Ordaz" : Gustavo Díaz Ordaz (1964-1970) ?][? if presidente == "Echeverria" : Luis Echeverría Álvarez (1970-1976) ?][? if presidente == "Lopez Portillo" : José López Portillo (1976-1982) ?][? if presidente == "De la Madrid" : Miguel de la Madrid (1982-1988) ?]

